      "items": [
        "Astro CLI 1.46 and Astro Runtime 3.3-9: Airflow 3.3.2 on Python 3.14",
        "LocalExecutor, so tasks run inside the scheduler container, as uid 1000 to write the host mount",
        "Mapped downloads and stages run at most three at a time"
      ]
